OL,3,GNEWSAWidow whose husband died after
OL,4,Afalling into slurry pit warns of
OL,5,Apressure on farmers
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe widow of a farmer who died after he
OL,8,Ffell into a slurry pit has spoken about
OL,9,Fthe stresses facing workers after a
OL,10,Frise in deaths.
OL,12,FMargaret Owen said the impact of
OL,13,Fhusband Islwyn's death had been brought
OL,14,Fback to her once again following
OL,15,Freports that a father and son had died
OL,16,Fin similar circumstances last week.
OL,18,FShe said Islwyn had worried about bad
OL,19,Fweather and recently-introduced rules
OL,20,Fon slurry spreading when he had fallen
OL,21,Fat his farm in Bala, Gwynedd, in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
