OL,3,GNEWSAWidow whose husband died after
OL,4,Afalling into slurry pit warns of
OL,5,Apressure on farmers
OL,6,
OL,7,FLatest figures from the Health and
OL,8,FSafety Executive (HSE) show 22 workers
OL,9,Fdied on British farms during 2025-26 -
OL,10,Fthe highest number in a decade.
